        "x1": 0.8490261437908497,
        "y1": 0.4893964646464646
      },
      "text": "There have been a lot of changes in my life in the last two years, and I have decided to move from western Washington where I have lived all my life to Carlsbad, California. I have some family in the area and had met a friend there last year. She is a world traveler and an avid photographer. But the Northwest will always be my \"home\".",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5294934640522876,
        "y0": 0.5104722222222222,
        "x1": 0.8348660130718955,
        "y1": 0.5939671717171717
      },
      "text": "The travel bug is still with me having traveled to Europe, Africa, South America and Antarctica since we last met and with a few weeks in Southeast Asia scheduled for February.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
